{"seq":3,"slug":"extended-chords","title":"延伸和弦与复杂结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/extended-chords","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"延伸和弦与复杂结构\">延伸和弦与复杂结构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>延伸和弦是继续按三度叠置、在七和弦之上叠加九音、十一音、十三音而得到的五音至七音和弦。这里的关键不在于&quot;音越多越好&quot;，而在于两个实践约束：一是完整呈现会带来音程冲突（如属十一和弦中三音与十一音的半音撞击），二是低频区音程过密会造成浑浊，因此真实编配几乎总要省略与开放排列。除三度叠置外，挂留和弦与附加音和弦提供了另外两条构造路径。后文九和弦家族、十一/十三和弦与编配原则均由此展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸和弦的构成逻辑\">延伸和弦的构成逻辑</h2><p>延伸和弦（Extended Chords）是在七和弦基础上继续按三度叠置而产生的五音、六音、七音和弦。叠加的音按照与根音的音程距离命名：九度音、十一度音、十三度音。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>九和弦</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>七和弦</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>九音</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{九和弦} = \\text{七和弦} + \\text{九音}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">九和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">七和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">九音</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>十一和弦</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>九和弦</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>十一音</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{十一和弦} = \\text{九和弦} + \\text{十一音}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">十一和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">九和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">十一音</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>十三和弦</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>十一和弦</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>十三音</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{十三和弦} = \\text{十一和弦} + \\text{十三音}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">十三和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">十一和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">十三音</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>十三和弦理论上包含七个不同音高——恰好覆盖了一个调的全部音级。在实际编配中，延伸和弦几乎不会完整呈现所有音，而是根据音响需要有选择地<strong>省略</strong>某些音。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;根音 C&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;三音 E&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;五音 G&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;七音 B♭&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;九音 D&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;十一音 F&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;十三音 A&quot;]&#10;    D -.-&gt; D1[&quot;C9&quot;]&#10;    E -.-&gt; E1[&quot;C11&quot;]&#10;    F -.-&gt; F1[&quot;C13&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"根音 C\"] --&gt; B[\"三音 E\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"五音 G\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"七音 B♭\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"九音 D\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"十一音 F\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"十三音 A\"]\n    D -.-&gt; D1[\"C9\"]\n    E -.-&gt; E1[\"C11\"]\n    F -.-&gt; F1[\"C13\"]</pre><h2 id=\"九和弦家族\">九和弦家族</h2><p>九和弦在爵士、放克与 Neo-Soul 中极为常见。主要类型包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>九和弦类型</th>\n<th>构成</th>\n<th>标记</th>\n<th>色彩</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属九和弦</td>\n<td>属七 + 大九度</td>\n<td>C9</td>\n<td>明亮、放克感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大九和弦</td>\n<td>大七 + 大九度</td>\n<td>Cmaj9</td>\n<td>温暖、开阔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小九和弦</td>\n<td>小七 + 大九度</td>\n<td>Cm9</td>\n<td>柔美、深邃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属♭9和弦</td>\n<td>属七 + 小九度</td>\n<td>C7♭9</td>\n<td>紧张、异域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属♯9和弦</td>\n<td>属七 + 增九度</td>\n<td>C7♯9</td>\n<td>粗犷、Hendrix和弦</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>属♯9和弦（如 E7♯9）因 Jimi Hendrix 在《Purple Haze》中的标志性使用而被称为&quot;Hendrix Chord&quot;。它的特殊之处在于同时包含大三度（E-G♯）和增九度（= 小三度的等音 E-G），大小调色彩的并存产生了强烈的张力。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E7\\sharp9 = E - G\\sharp - B - D - G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">7♯9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"十一和弦与十三和弦\">十一和弦与十三和弦</h2><p>十一和弦与十三和弦在爵士编曲和管弦乐配器中使用广泛，但需要注意音程冲突问题：</p>\n<p><strong>十一和弦的关键问题</strong>：在属十一和弦（如 C11）中，大三度音 E 与十一度音 F 之间仅有半音距离，产生强烈冲突。解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>省略三音（使和弦变为 sus4 色彩）</li>\n<li>使用♯11（升十一度），避开冲突</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{maj7\\sharp11} = C - E - G - B - F\\sharp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">maj</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7♯11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是著名的&quot;Lydian 和弦&quot;——大七和弦加升十一度，产生 Lydian 调式的梦幻色彩。</p>\n<p><strong>十三和弦</strong>通常省略五音与十一音，保留核心框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C13 = C - E - (G) - B\\flat - D - (F) - A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>实际常用配置：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{实际常用配置：} C - E - B\\flat - D - A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际常用配置：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延伸和弦</th>\n<th>必保留音</th>\n<th>可省略音</th>\n<th>音响特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>9和弦</td>\n<td>R, 3, 7, 9</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>丰满但清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11和弦</td>\n<td>R, 7, 9, 11</td>\n<td>3, 5</td>\n<td>开阔、悬浮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>♯11和弦</td>\n<td>R, 3, 7, ♯11</td>\n<td>5, 9</td>\n<td>Lydian 梦幻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13和弦</td>\n<td>R, 3, 7, 13</td>\n<td>5, 9, 11</td>\n<td>丰富、全频</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 延伸和弦的省略策略&#10;        A[&quot;完整13和弦&lt;br/&gt;7个音&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;省略5音&lt;br/&gt;(对色彩影响最小)&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;省略11音&lt;br/&gt;(避免与3音冲突)&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;实际4-5个音&lt;br/&gt;的高效配置&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 延伸和弦的省略策略\n        A[\"完整13和弦&lt;br/&gt;7个音\"] --&gt; B[\"省略5音&lt;br/&gt;(对色彩影响最小)\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"省略11音&lt;br/&gt;(避免与3音冲突)\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"实际4-5个音&lt;br/&gt;的高效配置\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"挂留和弦与附加音和弦\">挂留和弦与附加音和弦</h2><p>除了三度叠置产生的延伸和弦，还有两类重要的和弦构造方式：</p>\n<p><strong>挂留和弦（Suspended Chords）</strong>：用二度或四度替代三音，消除大/小调性质。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>四度替代三度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Csus4 = C - F - G \\quad (\\text{四度替代三度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">四度替代三度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>二度替代三度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Csus2 = C - D - G \\quad (\\text{二度替代三度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">二度替代三度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>挂留和弦因缺少三音而产生&quot;开放&quot;&quot;未决&quot;的听觉效果，常用于制造悬念或作为装饰性延迟解决（sus → 自然和弦）。</p>\n<p><strong>附加音和弦（Add Chords）</strong>：在三和弦基础上直接添加某个音，<strong>不经过七音的中介</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>三和弦直接加九度，无七音</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cadd9 = C - E - G - D \\quad (\\text{三和弦直接加九度，无七音})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">dd</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">三和弦直接加九度，无七音</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi><mn>9</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mtext>，包含七音</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cadd9 \\neq C9 \\quad (C9 = C - E - G - B\\flat - D，\\text{包含七音})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">dd</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">包含七音</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个区别至关重要——add9 和弦清新明亮（无七音的紧张感），而 9 和弦丰富复杂（七音增添了层次）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸和弦在当代音乐中的编配\">延伸和弦在当代音乐中的编配</h2><p>在 DAW 编曲中使用延伸和弦需要考虑以下实践原则：</p>\n<p><strong>频率分布</strong>：延伸音（9、11、13）通常放在较高的声部，根音与五音放在较低声部，避免低频区域的音程过密造成浑浊。</p>\n<p><strong>voicing 开放化</strong>：将和弦音散布在超过一个八度的范围内（open voicing），比紧密排列（close voicing）更适合延伸和弦的呈现。</p>\n<p><strong>context 决定选择</strong>：同一个和弦在不同编配语境中可以选择不同的延伸：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安静段落：maj9、m9（温暖、内省）</li>\n<li>放克律动：9、13（明亮、推动力）</li>\n<li>紧张段落：7♭9、7♯9、7♭13（不协和、张力）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2024-2025 年的 Neo-Soul 和 Lo-Fi 制作趋势中，Cmaj9、Fmaj7♯11、Dm11 等延伸和弦已成为标志性的和声色彩。Steve Lacy、Daniel Caesar、Tom Misch 等艺人的作品大量运用精巧的延伸和弦配置，影响了整个独立音乐的和声审美。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>延伸和弦 = 七和弦继续叠置三度，得到 9、11、13 音和弦。</li>\n<li>实际编配几乎不完整呈现，按音响需要省略音。</li>\n<li>九和弦家族（属九、大九、小九、♭9、♯9）各具色彩，♯9 即 Hendrix 和弦。</li>\n<li>十一和弦的大三度与十一度冲突，靠省略三音或用 ♯11 化解。</li>\n<li>十三和弦通常省略五音与十一音，保留 R-3-7-13 核心。</li>\n<li>挂留和弦（sus2/sus4）与附加音和弦（add9）是另一类构造方式。</li>\n<li>编配原则：延伸音置于高声部、开放 voicing、按语境选延伸。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>延伸和弦是七和弦继续叠置三度的产物，先掌握七和弦五种类型：<a href=\"seventh-chords\">七和弦体系</a></li>\n<li>九、十一、十三音的命名建立在复合音程之上，回顾音程概念：<a href=\"../../music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/intervals\">音程体系</a></li>\n<li>延伸和弦的省略与开放排列（voicing）在爵士中发展为一门技艺：<a href=\"../modern-harmony/jazz-harmony\">爵士和声体系</a></li>\n<li>在编曲层面如何将延伸音分配到不同乐器声部，见配器中的和声排列：<a href=\"../../arrangement-orchestration/texture-voicing/harmonic-voicing-voice-leading\">和声配置与声部连接</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"延伸和弦与复杂结构","id":"延伸和弦与复杂结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸和弦的构成逻辑","id":"延伸和弦的构成逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"九和弦家族","id":"九和弦家族"},{"level":2,"text":"十一和弦与十三和弦","id":"十一和弦与十三和弦"},{"level":2,"text":"挂留和弦与附加音和弦","id":"挂留和弦与附加音和弦"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸和弦在当代音乐中的编配","id":"延伸和弦在当代音乐中的编配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"七和弦体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/seventh-chords"},"next":{"title":"功能和声与进行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-progressions/functional-harmony"}}